Package: xyz.regulad.blackb0x.icanhasrez
Name: blackb0x resolution unlock
Version: __BLACKB0X_VERSION__
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Lets Settings offer the television's own native resolution. QuartzCore decides whether a (width, height) pair can be a display mode at all from a hardcoded list of ten, so a panel whose native timing is not on it -- 1360x768, for one -- can never be driven natively. Its own "this is the panel's size" escape clause is never reached because the display's native-size fields are left empty; this fills them in from the EDID's preferred timing and lets Apple's stock code do the rest.
Maintainer: regulad <regulad@regulad.xyz>
Author: regulad <regulad@regulad.xyz>
Section: System
Depends: firmware (>= 7.0), mobilesubstrate
Tag: role::hacker
